entences":[{"en":"Truman Dickerson is the Weekend News Fellow at Business Insider, based in New York City.","zh":"杜鲁门·迪克森 (Truman Dickerson) 是《商业内幕》的周末新闻研究员，驻纽约市。"},{"en":"He covers trending tech and business news.","zh":"他报道热门科技和商业新闻。"},{"en":"He previously reported for The Boston Globe's Express Desk.","zh":"他此前曾为《波士顿环球报》的 Express Desk 进行报道。"},{"en":"He graduated from Boston University, where he served as editor in chief of The Daily Free Press, BU's student-run newspaper.Contact him at Tdickerson@insider.com","zh":"他毕业于波士顿大学，曾担任波士顿大学学生报纸《自由日报》的主编。请通过 Tdickerson@insider.com 与他联系"}]},{"html_en":"<li>\n                  <a data-track-click=\"\" href=\"/category/anthropic\" title=\"Anthropic\">Anthropic</a>\n                </li>","sentences":[{"en":"Anthropic","zh":"人择"}]},{"html_en":"<li>\n                  <a data-track-click=\"\" href=\"/category/ai\" title=\"AI\">AI</a>\n                </li>","sentences":[]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><section data-content-container=\"\" role=\"main\">\n\n\n  <section>\n      \n        \n      \n        <div data-load-strategy=\"disable-lazy\" data-component-type=\"post-top\" data-e2e-name=\"post-top\">\n      \n              \n              \n            \n              \n              \n              \n              \n                <div data-e2e-name=\"post-byline\" data-component-type=\"post-byline\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-byline\">\n                          <p>By Truman Dickerson You're currently following this author! Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.</p>\n                        </div>\n          </div>\n      \n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <section id=\"post-body\" data-component-type=\"post-body\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-lock-content=\"\">\n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-hero\" data-component-type=\"post-hero\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\">\n                    <figure data-type=\"img\" data-e2e-name=\"image-figure-image\" data-media-container=\"image\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n                        <div>\n                          <meta itemprop=\"contentUrl\" content=\"https://i.insider.com/6afde96ed6c5d341c9b4a926?width=1200\">\n                          <p><img src=\"https://i.insider.com/6afde96ed6c5d341c9b4a926?width=700\" srcset=\"https://i.insider.com/6afde96ed6c5d341c9b4a926?width=400&format=jpeg&auto=webp 400w, https://i.insider.com/6afde96ed6c5d341c9b4a926?width=500&format=jpeg&auto=webp 500w, https://i.insider.com/6afde96ed6c5d341c9b4a926?width=700&format=jpeg&auto=webp 700w, https://i.insider.com/6afde96ed6c5d341c9b4a926?width=1000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1000w, https://i.insider.com/6afde96ed6c5d341c9b4a926?width=1300&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1300w, https://i.insider.com/6afde96ed6c5d341c9b4a926?width=2000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 2000w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 900px\" alt=\"NEW YORK, NEW YORK - OCTOBER 5: Former Anthropic researcher Jacob Coxon testifies during a New York City Council Committee hearing on the risks and regulation of artificial intelligence at City Hall on October 5, 2026 in New York City. Top executives from OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, and Meta are testifying under oath today at an NYC Council Committee of the Whole Hearing, to address artificial intelligence safety risks and proposed municipal regulations. (Photo by Adam Gray/Getty Images)\" decoding=\"sync\">\n                        </p></div>\n                    \n                          <figcaption data-e2e-name=\"image-caption\">Adam Gray/Getty Images AI engineerJacob Coxon said he's donating his equity in OpenAI to AI safety research.</figcaption>\n                    </figure>\n              </div>\n    \n    \n    \n          \n    \n            <div data-e2e-name=\"post-details\">\n                \n                \n                \n                \n                  <p><time data-timestamp=\"2026-11-18T19:46:02.022Z\" data-disable-relative-formatting=\"\">\n                      2026-11-18T19:46:02.022Z\n                    </time>\n                  </p>\n              </div>\n    \n    \n          \n    \n            \n            \n            \n    \n          \n    \n      <section data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" data-component-type=\"image-modal\" data-track-content=\"\" data-post-type=\"story\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-body-content\">\n                \n                      <p>Jacob Coxon is forking over what could be a massive personal windfall in the name of AI safety.</p><p>The ex-OpenAI researcher, who also worked at Anthropic before he recently quit, said on Wednesday that he's committed to selling his equity in OpenAI and donating the proceeds to AI safety causes.</p><p>\"We need to pause or drastically slow down the race to superintelligence,\" he said on X. \"Everything else is a distraction.\"</p><p>In doing so, Coxon is forgoing what could be millions of dollars in profit that would become liquid when OpenAI goes public, an event that CEO Sam Altman has said is on the horizon.</p><p>Coxon made serious waves in September when he left Anthropic and issued a series of dire warnings that it and OpenAI were \"gambling with our lives.\"</p><p>\"The people building AI earnestly believe that it could kill us all by the end of the decade,\" he said in an X post on September 8 that has since racked up 175 million views. \"This is not a marketing stunt.\"</p><p>Coxon worked at OpenAI from 2023 until 2026, before leaving for Anthropic. Since then, the 27-year-old from England has done the rounds with media to advocate for AI safeguards and, principally, a pause on recursive self-improvement, the process by which AI models train themselves.</p><p>In a November 9 talk at Stanford, Coxon called his stake in OpenAI \"blood money\" but balked at giving it up at the time.</p><p>\"I like money, bro,\" he said. \"My parents were like worried I was having a psychotic break. I think if I'd also given away all the money they'd be even more convinced of that.\"</p>\n                \n                \n                  </section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      </section>\n\n    \n    <!-- Included desktop \"post-aside\" -->    \n\n    \n      \n      <section data-component-type=\"post-bottom\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-bottom\">\n        <section>\n    \n    \n            \n            \n    \n            \n            \n            <section data-component-type=\"read-next\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next\" data-display-size=\"4\" data-post-id=\"6afde90ba39a61840d331a8a\" data-root-margin=\"250px 0px\" data-track-view=\"{&quot;subscription_experience&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;}\">\n              <h2>阅读下一篇</h2>\n            \n              <div data-track-click-shared=\"{&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;,&quot;click_text&quot;:&quot;Read next&quot;}\" data-recommendations-content=\"\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next-list\" data-recommendations-list=\"\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    <article data-component-type=\"tout\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-post-id=\"post\">\n                     \n                          \n                            <span>    <p><img data-src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" data-old-src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1 1'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" alt=\"\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            </p>  </span>\n                          \n                    \n                    \n                          <h3>商业内幕讲述您想知道的创新故事</h3>\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    </article>        \n                    \n                    \n                    <article data-component-type=\"tout\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-post-id=\"post\">\n                     \n                          \n                            <span>    <p><img data-src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" data-old-src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1 1'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" alt=\"\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            </p>  </span>\n                          \n                    \n                    \n                          <h3>商业内幕讲述您想知道的创新故事</h3>\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    </article>        \n                    \n                    \n                    <article data-component-type=\"tout\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-post-id=\"post\">\n                     \n                          \n                            <span>    <p><img data-src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" data-old-src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1 1'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" alt=\"\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            </p>  </span>\n                          \n                    \n                    \n                          <h3>商业内幕讲述您想知道的创新故事</h3>\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    </article>        \n                    \n                    \n                    <article data-component-type=\"tout\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-post-id=\"post\">\n                     \n                          \n                            <span>    <p><img data-src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" data-old-src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1 1'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" alt=\"\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            </p>  </span>\n                          \n                    \n                    \n                          <h3>商业内幕讲述您想知道的创新故事</h3>\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    </article>    </div>\n            \n              <template data-recommendations-template=\"\">\n                <article data-e2e-name=\"read-next-item\" data-recommendations-item=\"\">\n                  <a data-e2e-name=\"read-next-image-link\" data-recommendations-image-link=\"\" data-recommendations-link=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n                    <div data-e2e-name=\"read-next-video\" data-recommendations-video=\"\">\n                      <p>\n                                  </p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                  </a>\n                  <h3>\n                    <a data-e2e-name=\"read-next-title-link\" data-recommendations-link=\"\" data-recommendations-title=\"\"></a>\n                  </h3>\n                </article>\n              </template>\n            </section>      \n          \n        <div data-track-click-shared=\"{&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;author_bio&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;navigation&quot;}\" data-track-view=\"{&quot;subscription_experience&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;author_bio&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;module_in_view&quot;}\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-component-type=\"post-bottom-authors\">\n            <div>\n                <a href=\"https://www.busi